@startuml
title Datamak E-Commerce System - Use Case Diagram

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Guest Visitor" as Guest
actor "Registered Customer" as Customer
actor "Administrator" as Admin
actor "Simulated Payment\nService" as PaymentService

Customer --|> Guest
Admin --|> Guest

rectangle "Datamak E-Commerce System\n(Web App, Mobile App, REST API)" {
  usecase "Browse information\npages" as UC_PublicPages
  usecase "Register account" as UC_Register
  usecase "Login" as UC_Login
  usecase "Request password\nreset" as UC_ForgotPassword
  usecase "Reset password" as UC_ResetPassword
  usecase "Browse product\ncatalog" as UC_BrowseCatalog
  usecase "Search, filter,\nand sort products" as UC_SearchFilter
  usecase "View product\ndetails" as UC_ProductDetails
  usecase "View hosting\nplans" as UC_HostingPlans

  usecase "Manage profile" as UC_Profile
  usecase "Manage wishlist" as UC_Wishlist
  usecase "Manage shopping\ncart" as UC_Cart
  usecase "Add item to cart" as UC_AddCart
  usecase "Update or remove\ncart item" as UC_UpdateCart
  usecase "Checkout" as UC_Checkout
  usecase "Apply coupon" as UC_Coupon
  usecase "Simulate payment" as UC_Payment
  usecase "Place order" as UC_PlaceOrder
  usecase "View order history" as UC_OrderHistory
  usecase "Track order status" as UC_TrackOrder
  usecase "View recently\nviewed products" as UC_RecentViews

  usecase "View admin dashboard\nsummary" as UC_AdminSummary
  usecase "Manage products" as UC_ManageProducts
  usecase "Create product" as UC_CreateProduct
  usecase "Update product" as UC_UpdateProduct
  usecase "Delete product" as UC_DeleteProduct
  usecase "Upload product images" as UC_UploadImages
  usecase "Manage orders" as UC_ManageOrders
  usecase "Update order status" as UC_UpdateStatus
  usecase "Manage users" as UC_ManageUsers
  usecase "Change user role" as UC_ChangeRole
}

Guest --> UC_PublicPages
Guest --> UC_Register
Guest --> UC_Login
Guest --> UC_ForgotPassword
Guest --> UC_ResetPassword
Guest --> UC_BrowseCatalog
Guest --> UC_SearchFilter
Guest --> UC_ProductDetails
Guest --> UC_HostingPlans

Customer --> UC_Profile
Customer --> UC_Wishlist
Customer --> UC_Cart
Customer --> UC_Checkout
Customer --> UC_OrderHistory
Customer --> UC_TrackOrder
Customer --> UC_RecentViews

Admin --> UC_AdminSummary
Admin --> UC_ManageProducts
Admin --> UC_ManageOrders
Admin --> UC_ManageUsers

UC_BrowseCatalog .> UC_SearchFilter : <<include>>
UC_ProductDetails .> UC_BrowseCatalog : <<extend>>
UC_HostingPlans .> UC_BrowseCatalog : <<extend>>

UC_Cart .> UC_AddCart : <<include>>
UC_Cart .> UC_UpdateCart : <<include>>

UC_Checkout .> UC_Cart : <<include>>
UC_Checkout .> UC_Coupon : <<extend>>
UC_Checkout .> UC_Payment : <<include>>
UC_Checkout .> UC_PlaceOrder : <<include>>
PaymentService --> UC_Payment

UC_OrderHistory .> UC_TrackOrder : <<include>>

UC_ManageProducts .> UC_CreateProduct : <<include>>
UC_ManageProducts .> UC_UpdateProduct : <<include>>
UC_ManageProducts .> UC_DeleteProduct : <<include>>
UC_ManageProducts .> UC_UploadImages : <<extend>>

UC_ManageOrders .> UC_UpdateStatus : <<include>>
UC_ManageUsers .> UC_ChangeRole : <<include>>

note right of UC_Payment
Payment is simulated by the backend
during checkout for this assignment.
end note

@enduml
